{"id":"665454","name":"酸辣土豆丝","author":"芊芊美食记WQ","authorId":"10676629","desc":"","cover":"images/665454/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"土豆","amount":"两个"},{"name":"葱","amount":"适量"},{"name":"蒜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"青椒","amount":"2个"},{"name":"米椒","amount":"几个"}],"sub":[{"name":"油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡精","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"土豆去皮，清洗干净，切成丝。","img":"images/665454/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"用凉水清洗干净淀粉。","img":"images/665454/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"起锅烧水，水开后下入土豆丝。","img":"images/665454/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加少许醋，焯水30秒。","img":"images/665454/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"捞出沥干水分。","img":"images/665454/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"起锅烧油，下入葱头和蒜末。","img":"images/665454/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"超出香味。","img":"images/665454/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"下入小米椒。","img":"images/665454/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加入一勺醋和一勺生抽。","img":"images/665454/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"炒出香味。","img":"images/665454/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"下入土豆丝，加少许盐和鸡精调味。","img":"images/665454/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"翻炒均匀，最后加入青椒丝。","img":"images/665454/step_12.png"},{"step":13,"desc":"再次翻炒均匀即可出锅。","img":"images/665454/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"好了。","img":"images/665454/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"酸辣脆爽，超级下饭。","img":"images/665454/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}